# Creature routes by size (src/lab/tubes/VentRoutes.cpp): two rooms (north y 1-9, south y 14-22, x 1-13) parted by a
# 4 m wall, a concrete culvert (bld_culvert) through it. A 2 m culvert (1.56 m inside) at x 4-6 and no other
# way: the Huntsman follows the player through it; the Brute waits at the mouth he went in by.
size 640 360
frames 1500
vent-x 5
vent-width 2
runner-1 Huntsman 1 through 2.5 3
runner-2 Brute 1 around 9.5 3
sealed 1
begin-campaign
